      "content": "1.5 Important Exam Points"
    },
    {
      "id": "pgs65ni",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "The word computer comes from 'compute' meaning calculate.",
        "Digital computers work on binary numbers (0 and 1).",
        "ENIAC is an example of a first generation computer.",
        "Transistors were used in second generation computers.",
        "Microprocessors are used in fourth generation computers.",
        "Fifth generation computers are based on Artificial Intelligence."
      ]
